  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "常见丢分:只写“验收合格”",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "wrong_idea",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，S01 这类题别一上来写“验收合格”。考场真正问的是：这套脚手架或模板支架，能不能安全放行。今天只练一条链：先取数分档，再看构造稳不稳，最后写成验收放行的采分句。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 16.536,
      "requestId": "e53a686c-abd7-91ba-bdbd-59cc4612dbc4",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "load_path",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "先看它为什么会垮",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[load_path].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "为什么先看传力？因为它不是一个普通物品清单，而是临时受力系统。荷载从作业面落到立杆，再到底座和地基；连墙件、剪刀撑、扫地杆，是防侧倒、防底部失稳、防整体垮塌的。对象读错，后面验收项目就会写散。",
      "startSec": 16.936,
      "durSec": 18.936,
      "requestId": "a498a1cb-28c8-93c8-abd0-bbb1f41e4dde",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "threshold_gate",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "第一刀:取数分档",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[thresholds].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "有了对象以后，第一刀才是取数。高度 H、搭设跨度、施工总荷载、集中线荷载，逐个拿来比阈值。比如高大模板支撑常见四道门：H 达到 8 米、跨度达到 18 米、总荷载达到 15 千牛每平方米、线荷载达到 20 千牛每米。命中的是风险口径，后面的论证程序再交给 J01。",
      "startSec": 36.272,
      "durSec": 25.824,
      "requestId": "93bfb938-361e-94c2-866d-88080867ad2f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "structure_gate",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "第二刀:构造稳不稳",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[structure_gate].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "但注意，命中阈值只说明风险高，不等于可以使用。第二刀看构造有没有把风险控制住：扫地杆稳住底部，连墙件约束侧向，剪刀撑保证整体刚度，拆除顺序防止承重路径突然断掉。考试问搭设错误，就在这些位置找；考试问放行，就把这些变成验收依据。",
      "startSec": 62.496,
      "durSec": 22.56,
      "requestId": "3ab7b576-ebe7-90aa-9e03-b5aaf1717734",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "acceptance_gate",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "第三刀:验收四件套",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[acceptance_four].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "构造解决的是“稳不稳”，验收解决的是“证据够不够”。答题纸上要落到四件套：材料合格，支承固定可靠，架体搭设质量符合要求，技术资料和验收记录齐全。只写一句“验收合格”，没有告诉阅卷人你验收了什么，采分颗粒是不够的。",
      "startSec": 85.456,
      "durSec": 20.712,
      "requestId": "c0c18d51-3c19-9c95-913e-8f4abd715e12",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "错法:把结论当答案",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[only_conclusion].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "所以常见丢分不是完全不会，而是把结论当答案。比如只写“验收合格，可以使用”，看着没错，但它漏了对象，漏了验收项目，也漏了放行条件。阅卷时最稳的写法，是让对象、检查项目和结论同时出现。",
      "startSec": 106.568,
      "durSec": 18.144,
      "requestId": "54bf4bfb-aa31-9ea3-ab64-56164afb473c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "落答题纸",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[score_phrase].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后把这条链写成一句能拿分的话：脚手架或模板支架，经材料、支承固定、搭设质量和技术资料验收合格后，方可使用。记住，不是背一堆规范名，而是把题目翻译成三步：取数分档，构造稳定，验收放行。",
      "startSec": 125.112,
      "durSec": 18.888,
      "requestId": "a5dc73fd-5b8c-9028-b53c-36601aba7080",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，我就写“验收合格”，能拿分不？",
      "startSec": 144.4,
      "durSec": 4.224,
      "requestId": "7fcd85c3-5847-9fd1-a357-7fc969e1cd71",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[only_conclusion].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不够。你没交代验收了什么，也没写放行条件。至少把对象、验收项目和结论带上。",
      "startSec": 149.024,
      "durSec": 7.944,
      "requestId": "06764e5b-7e79-92ff-bcbf-885102804e50",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "这块是不是一看到 8 米，就直接写专家论证？",
      "startSec": 157.368,
      "durSec": 4.896,
      "requestId": "585fa2ae-b82c-907b-8944-c64b3e1f7d6c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[mix_thresholds].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先别急。你得先判对象。高大模板支撑 H 达到 8 米是论证口径，落地脚手架又有另一套高度门槛。先取对象，再比阈值。",
      "startSec": 162.664,
      "durSec": 11.448,
      "requestId": "1edae442-5171-9cc9-b030-4d0c938f61fe",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那扫地杆、连墙件这些，我要不要都写上啊？",
      "startSec": 174.512,
      "durSec": 8.28,
      "requestId": "89d9e88a-4456-9c00-ae80-6ca90de844d9",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[scatter_specs].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "看题问什么。问搭设错误，就写具体构造点；问验收放行，就把构造合格放进验收依据，别把规范散点一股脑堆上去。",
      "startSec": 183.192,
      "durSec": 10.344,
      "requestId": "fc32c521-5787-95cb-a680-e826d3804898",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后收束一句哈：S01 不是背脚手架散点，而是把安全题写成三步采分链。先取数分档，再看构造稳定，最后验收放行。现在进闯关，看你能不能把这句话写稳。",
      "startSec": 193.936,
      "durSec": 14.472,
      "requestId": "9b44cc93-c96b-9003-90cc-562f30121498",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}